{"seq":3,"slug":"idempotency-side-effects","title":"副作用幂等与外部系统对接","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/long-running-workflow-engines/workers-activities/idempotency-side-effects","wordCount":1500,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"副作用幂等与外部系统对接\">副作用幂等与外部系统对接</h1><p>上一篇算清了 Activity 会被重试多少次，这一篇处理它的后果：<strong>每一次重试都是一次真实的重复调用</strong>。引擎无法替你消除重复，只能替你记录&quot;哪些尝试的确认已经收到&quot;。外部世界的幂等设计是 Activity 作者的责任，也是长流程系统里最容易留下数据事故的地方。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>先把重复的来源精确化。Temporal 的 Activity 语义是<strong>至少一次尝试</strong>，但&quot;确认丢失&quot;这个窗口比想象中窄也更常见：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;  participant WF as Workflow&#10;  participant S as Server&#10;  participant AW as Activity Worker&#10;  participant EXT as 外部系统(支付网关)&#10;  WF-&gt;&gt;S: ScheduleActivityTask&#10;  S-&gt;&gt;AW: 派发尝试 #1&#10;  AW-&gt;&gt;EXT: POST /charge&#10;  EXT-&gt;&gt;EXT: 扣款成功 ✓&#10;  EXT--&gt;&gt;AW: 200 {paymentId}&#10;  Note over AW: Worker 在此刻崩溃&#10;  AW--xS: 结果未上报&#10;  S-&gt;&gt;S: startToClose 超时 → 重试&#10;  S-&gt;&gt;AW: 派发尝试 #2&#10;  AW-&gt;&gt;EXT: POST /charge  ★ 重复扣款风险\">sequenceDiagram\n  participant WF as Workflow\n  participant S as Server\n  participant AW as Activity Worker\n  participant EXT as 外部系统(支付网关)\n  WF-&gt;&gt;S: ScheduleActivityTask\n  S-&gt;&gt;AW: 派发尝试 #1\n  AW-&gt;&gt;EXT: POST /charge\n  EXT-&gt;&gt;EXT: 扣款成功 ✓\n  EXT--&gt;&gt;AW: 200 {paymentId}\n  Note over AW: Worker 在此刻崩溃\n  AW--xS: 结果未上报\n  S-&gt;&gt;S: startToClose 超时 → 重试\n  S-&gt;&gt;AW: 派发尝试 #2\n  AW-&gt;&gt;EXT: POST /charge  ★ 重复扣款风险</pre><p>关键认知：<strong>&quot;外部效果已发生&quot;与&quot;引擎知道效果已发生&quot;是两件独立的事</strong>。图里扣款已经成功，但历史里没有 <code>ActivityTaskCompleted</code> 事件，于是引擎必须重试。这不是引擎的缺陷，而是分布式系统里确认不可靠的必然结果——任何&quot;发出请求后等待回执&quot;的协议都有这个窗口。</p>\n<p>因此幂等设计的目标不是&quot;避免重复调用&quot;，而是&quot;<strong>让重复调用无害</strong>&quot;。四条路径：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>路径</th>\n<th>做法</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>A. 外部系统原生幂等</td>\n<td>传幂等键（Stripe <code>Idempotency-Key</code>、支付宝 <code>out_trade_no</code>、K8s 资源名）</td>\n<td>下游支持幂等键，首选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>B. 本地去重表</td>\n<td>首次执行时把 <code>(workflowId, activityId)</code> 写入唯一索引表</td>\n<td>下游不支持幂等键、且你能控制一处数据库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C. 状态收敛写法</td>\n<td>用&quot;设为 X&quot;代替&quot;增加 X&quot;（幂等更新而非累计操作）</td>\n<td>更新语义本身可幂等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>D. 前置检查 + 后置确认</td>\n<td>先查&quot;是否已完成&quot;，再决定执行</td>\n<td>查询可靠且比写入便宜</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>优先级是 A &gt; C &gt; B &gt; D：A 最省事且语义最强；C 通过改变操作语义从根上消灭问题；B 需要本地状态但覆盖面广；D 依赖查询的准确性，在缓存/主从延迟场景下不可靠。</p>\n<h2 id=\"幂等键的来源-activityid-是引擎送你的\">幂等键的来源：activityId 是引擎送你的</h2><p>Temporal 的每个 Activity 调度都有一个<strong>稳定的 <code>activityId</code></strong>，它在重试之间不变（默认是 activity type + 序列号，或你显式指定）。这天然就是幂等键，不需要自己生成：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { Context } from &#39;@temporalio/activity&#39;;&#10;import { createHash } from &#39;node:crypto&#39;;&#10;&#10;export async function chargeCard(req: ChargeReq): Promise&lt;ChargeRes&gt; {&#10;  const { workflowExecution, activityId, attempt } = Context.current().info;&#10;  const idempotencyKey = createHash(&#39;sha256&#39;).update(`${workflowExecution.workflowId}:${activityId}`).digest(&#39;hex&#39;);&#10;&#10;  const res = await fetch(&#39;https://api.payment.example/v1/charges&#39;, {&#10;    method: &#39;POST&#39;,&#10;    headers: {&#10;      &#39;Content-Type&#39;: &#39;application/json&#39;,&#10;      &#39;Idempotency-Key&#39;: idempotencyKey, // 重试时同键 → 下游返回首次结果&#10;    },&#10;    body: JSON.stringify({ amount: req.amount, token: req.token }),&#10;  });&#10;  if (!res.ok) {&#10;    const body = await res.text();&#10;    throw new ApplicationFailure(`charge failed: ${res.status}`, &#39;ChargeError&#39;, true, [body]);&#10;  }&#10;  return (await res.json()) as ChargeRes;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Context } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@temporalio/activity'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { createHash } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'node:crypto'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> chargeCard</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">req</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ChargeReq</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ChargeRes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">workflowExecution</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">activityId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">attempt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Context.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">current</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().info;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> idempotencyKey</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createHash</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'sha256'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">update</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">workflowExecution</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">workflowId</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}:${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">activityId</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">digest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'hex'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> res</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://api.payment.example/v1/charges'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    method: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'POST'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    headers: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      'Content-Type'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'application/json'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      'Idempotency-Key'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: idempotencyKey, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 重试时同键 → 下游返回首次结果</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    body: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">JSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stringify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ amount: req.amount, token: req.token }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">res.ok) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> body</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> res.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    throw</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ApplicationFailure</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`charge failed: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">res</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">status</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ChargeError'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, [body]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> res.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">json</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ChargeRes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三个细节决定了幂等键是否真的有效：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>键必须只由稳定量构成</strong>。<code>workflowId + activityId</code> 是稳定的；<code>attempt</code> 不是；<code>Date.now()</code> 不是。把 <code>attempt</code> 编进键等于给每次重试发一张新的通行证，幂等直接失效。</li>\n<li><strong>幂等键要有保留期</strong>。Stripe 等的幂等键通常保留 24 小时，超出后同键会被当成新请求。对跨天重试的 Activity，需要在本地去重表里做长期兜底。</li>\n<li><strong>键要跨 Continue-As-New 稳定</strong>。如果工作流用 <code>continueAsNew</code> 切段（见<a href=\"../durable-execution/history-replay\">历史与重放</a>），新 run 的 <code>activityId</code> 会重新计数——如果你希望&quot;跨 run 的同一业务步骤&quot;仍幂等，键里要用业务标识（如 <code>orderId + stepName</code>）而不是 <code>activityId</code>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"本地去重表的标准形状\">本地去重表的标准形状</h2><p>当下游没有幂等键时，用一张唯一索引表兜住每次重试：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE activity_dedup (&#10;  idem_key     VARCHAR(128) PRIMARY KEY,   -- workflowId:activityId 的哈希&#10;  status       VARCHAR(16)  NOT NULL,      -- PENDING | DONE&#10;  result       JSONB,                      -- 首次成功的返回值&#10;  created_at   TIMESTAMPTZ  NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  updated_at   TIMESTAMPTZ  NOT NULL DEFAULT now()&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 首次尝试: 抢占&#10;INSERT INTO activity_dedup (idem_key, status) VALUES ($1, &#39;PENDING&#39;)&#10;  ON CONFLICT (idem_key) DO NOTHING;&#10;-- 若未插入成功, 说明已有尝试在进行或已完成 → 走查询分支\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> activity_dedup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  idem_key     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- workflowId:activityId 的哈希</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- PENDING | DONE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  result       JSONB,                      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 首次成功的返回值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  updated_at   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 首次尝试: 抢占</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> activity_dedup (idem_key, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ($</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PENDING'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CONFLICT (idem_key) DO NOTHING;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 若未插入成功, 说明已有尝试在进行或已完成 → 走查询分支</span></span></code></pre></div><p>配套的三点纪律：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>抢占与副作用在同一事务内</strong>（或至少抢占先行）：若先写外部系统再写去重表，两者之间崩溃就留下一个&quot;外部已做、本地无记录&quot;的洞。</li>\n<li><strong>DONE 分支直接返回存储的 result</strong>，让重试在语义上等价于&quot;读取首次结果&quot;，从而把 Activity 变成幂等观感。</li>\n<li><strong>PENDING 分支的处理要小心</strong>：另一个尝试可能正在执行中（并发重试），此时要么等待轮询直到状态变更，要么返回可重试失败，让策略稍后再来。绝不能直接重复执行外部副作用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"非幂等操作的三类危险模式\">非幂等操作的三类危险模式</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>反模式</th>\n<th>后果</th>\n<th>修法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>UPDATE balance = balance - 100</code></td>\n<td>重复执行多次扣款</td>\n<td>改为带条件的状态迁移：<code>UPDATE ... WHERE version = $v</code>，或写台账流水并做唯一约束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>INSERT</code> 无唯一键</td>\n<td>重复行</td>\n<td>加业务唯一键 + <code>ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>POST /send-email</code>、<code>POST /sms</code></td>\n<td>重复通知打扰用户</td>\n<td>下游带幂等键，或用&quot;通知台账 + 唯一键&quot;；真发两次可接受时显式记录这个取舍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生成 ID / 取号</td>\n<td>跳号或用尽</td>\n<td>把取号放进 Activity 并幂等返回已有号（键 = 业务标识）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调用 AI 生成内容</td>\n<td>重复计费、结果不一致</td>\n<td>键 = 提示哈希 + 业务标识；首次结果落库</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>&quot;重复发一封邮件&quot;看起来无害，但在审批类流程里，&quot;重复提醒&quot;引发的用户困惑有时比数据错误更难查——所以<strong>通知类副作用也应该幂等</strong>，只是它的幂等成本最低（一条台账 + 唯一键）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"读操作也需要留意\">读操作也需要留意</h2><p>纯读听起来无需幂等，但有两个陷阱：一是<strong>读-改-写</strong>（read-modify-write）本质是写操作，重试时会基于过期快照再写，造成丢失更新——修法是把条件放进写入的 WHERE 子句（乐观锁），或把读写合并到一次服务端原子操作。二是<strong>读取时的副作用</strong>（计费查询、限流计数），某些 API 按次计费，重试会重复扣费。</p>\n<p>对第二类，用 Temporal 的 <code>MaximumAttempts=1</code> + 短超时更合适：读操作失败通常可以整体重试（由 Workflow 决定重新发起一次新的 Activity 调用），而不是让引擎自动重试同一次调用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Activity 是至少一次尝试，重复来源是&quot;外部效果已发生但确认未上报&quot;。</li>\n<li>目标不是避免重复调用，而是让重复调用无害；四条路径按 A（原生幂等键）&gt; C（幂等语义）&gt; B（本地去重表）&gt; D（前置检查）优先。</li>\n<li><code>workflowId + activityId</code> 是天然幂等键，但键必须只由稳定量构成，且跨 Continue-As-New 时要用业务标识。</li>\n<li>幂等键有保留期，跨天重试需要本地去重表做长期兜底。</li>\n<li>状态迁移优于累计操作，唯一约束优于裸 INSERT，通知类副作用也应幂等。</li>\n<li>读-改-写与按次计费的读都要按写操作对待。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"副作用幂等与外部系统对接","id":"副作用幂等与外部系统对接"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"幂等键的来源：activityId 是引擎送你的","id":"幂等键的来源-activityid-是引擎送你的"},{"level":2,"text":"本地去重表的标准形状","id":"本地去重表的标准形状"},{"level":2,"text":"非幂等操作的三类危险模式","id":"非幂等操作的三类危险模式"},{"level":2,"text":"读操作也需要留意","id":"读操作也需要留意"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"任务队列路由与 worker 扩缩容","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/long-running-workflow-engines/workers-activities/task-queues"},"next":{"title":"持久化定时器与长等待","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/long-running-workflow-engines/timers-signals/durable-timers"}}